  "description": "The AIR Belgie 3D is the pinnacle of Curve's much-loved Belgie road bike range, now available as a standalone frameset for riders who want to build their own dream spec. This high-end frame uses hybrid titanium and carbon construction, bonded, finished and painted entirely in Melbourne, Australia.\nLike every Curve frame, the AIR Belgie 3D is designed to be ridden, not just admired. Built with stiffness, performance and durability front of mind, an earlier prototype passed EFBE's demanding TRI-TEST® regime before this refined version reached production.\nWhat sets the 3D apart from the standard AIR Belgie is its 3D-printed titanium head tube, bottom bracket and dropouts — precision-engineered for a class-leading bond with the carbon tubeset and a cleaner, more minimal aesthetic than traditional lug construction allows. Combined with fully internal cable routing, this is as refined as a titanium race frame gets.\nFabrication of the titanium frame, carbon tubes and 3D-printed titanium elements is completed with Curve's trusted, established partners in China, before every frame is bonded and finished back in Melbourne. AIR artwork, painting and cosmetic finishing are completed entirely by hand in Curve's own paint facility, Candy Factory Paintworks. Part of Curve's ongoing commitment to bringing key manufacturing steps in-house, where every process can be controlled and refined.\nThis bundle includes the frame, fork, seat post and headset — ready for you to build your own complete AIR Belgie 3D with the groupset, wheels and finishing kit of your choice.",
